/* doc:C-ONESIDE */
/* the SETTLE ops of one face, in order: the members before the first blocker as
 * plain fields; the defer starts that lead the blocked part; the SEED; the
 * PARTITION; every blocked member in its place (a defer as its start); the
 * defers' joins at the tail. Runs are marked first, so the last member of
 * each carries the barrier. `forced` puts a partition in even with nothing after
 * it; `handsOut && syncLink` splits at the top (C-ONESIDE). */
